msgid "Traditional Helicopter – Loading the Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:9
#: 6bfa28665e5645d2979e3549d44df968
msgid "It is recommended to load the firmware in your autopilot and calibrate the accelerometer before installing it in the frame. This is not absolutely necessary, however, some helicopters are large and heavy. It is hard to place it in all the orientations necessary for accel calibration, and is much easier to do on the bench before installation. For desktop PC's the following ground station software applications can be used to load firmware, if ArduPilot firmware is already existing:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:16
#: 0614624283c544b89cba8d4c5ac22c54
msgid "1. `Mission Planner (Windows only) <https://ardupilot.org/planner/>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:19
#: 8e6d55a5c4ef49eda883284cd8e23dfe
msgid "2. `APM Planner2 (Windows, Mac or Linux) <https://ardupilot.org/planner2/>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:22
#: f973d70fcf53401e9882c4140b124792
msgid "3. `QGroundControl (Windows, Mac or Linux) <http://qgroundcontrol.com/>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:25
#: d08c0cc12a2d4e86a465476a472b5343
msgid "For autopilots loaded with non-ArduPilot firmware, follow the instructions on :ref:`this page <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:27
#: 73f6b5d8199e455da057553da05b2909
msgid "Be sure to select the current stable version for Traditional Helicopters and follow the instructions in your ground station."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:33
#: 96346e3a9b754f1fbc15cfb8aa50f9c6
msgid "Developers may also want to build the code and upload their own firmware. See the :ref:`Developer wiki <dev:home>` for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:37
#: d4bc4965c74a4fb1ae7e498f8348f810
msgid "Calibrating the accelerometer is identical to the procedure for other vehicles. :ref:`See this topic <common-accelerometer-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
